Chapter 13 demos require hardware or emulation that GitHub-hosted CI runners
do not reliably provide: Intel CET (Tiger Lake+/Zen 3+) for shadow-stack and
IBT enforcement, and qemu-user-static + aarch64-linux-gnu cross-toolchain
with -cpu max for PAC and MTE emulation. The Makefile `test` targets still
build the demos and invoke them where tooling is available, printing OK or
SKIP per demo; local reproduction inside the pinned lab image works.
